# Remotion sources — used only to render intro.mp4 locally; not served by the app
public/media/kling-avatar.mp4
public/media/intro-vo.mp3
public/media/intro-remotion.mp4

# Superseded lesson media — 778 MB of retired cuts (earlier voices, rejected
# motion routes, pre-recast Selena). Nothing in src/ references these paths;
# the lesson data only points at claims-01-av1/, siu-01-av1/ and ew-01-av1/.
#
# Excluded from the DEPLOYMENT only. The files stay on disk and in git, so
# rule 6 still holds and any superseded cut can be restored without a re-render.
# Two reasons: they were publicly fetchable on the preview URL (verified 206 on
# 2026-08-22), and they were nearly halving the deployment for no benefit.
public/media/*-superseded/
